            <div xml:id="d259">

                <pb facs="0271" n="263" sameAs="frus:frus1937v04/pg263"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/9445: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-17T13:00:00+08:00">August 17, 1937—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 17—10:55 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>454. [To Peiping:] Your 438, August 16, 4 p.m.<anchor n="54" xml:id="d259-f1"/>
                    On August 16 in a letter requesting Chinese Government to instruct military
                    authorities to avoid endangering Concession areas at Tientsin I also asked that
                    Chinese military authorities remember the existence of the Legation quarter in
                    Peiping in this connection.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
